#. Translators: title of the release notes page
#: src/adw-about-dialog.ui:264 src/adw-about-window.ui:262
msgid "What’s New"
msgstr "새 소식"

#. Translators: title of the details page (comment, website etc)
#: src/adw-about-dialog.ui:311 src/adw-about-window.ui:309
msgid "Details"
